    {
        "content": "<p>The compiler throws an error on <code>def foo</code>, but in fact <code>foo</code> contains no data, since <code>Setoid</code> has only a proof field and an <code>r : α → α → Prop</code> whose return type is <code>Prop</code>, so both are erased at runtime.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">warning: declaration uses `sorry`</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: `Classical.choice` not supported by code generator; consider marking definition as `noncomputable`</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Setoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Classical</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">choice</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- but `Setoid` has no data</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: class Setoid.{u} (α : Sort u) : Sort (max 1 u)</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">number of parameters: 1</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">fields:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  Setoid.r : α → α → Prop</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  Setoid.iseqv : Equivalence Setoid.r</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">constructor:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  Setoid.mk.{u} {α : Sort u} (r : α → α → Prop) (iseqv : Equivalence r) : Setoid α</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">print</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Setoid</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 591927526,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1777508707
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Is this any different to using it on Unit?</p>",
        "id": 591930955,
